{"id":"8507a2321359e6fd","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-prob2-product-probability.md","title":"ZFC Prob2 Product Probability","display":"df-zfc-prob2-product-probability — ZFC Prob2 Product Probability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob2-product-probability","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob2-product-probability"],"display":"df-zfc-prob2-product-probability — ZFC Prob2 Product Probability","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob2-product-probability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob2-product-probability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob2-product-probability — ZFC Prob2 Product Probability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" href=\"?note=29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite\">../batch04/58-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (index set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec X=\\langle X_i:i\\in I\\rangle\">\\(\\vec X=\\langle X_i:i\\in I\\rangle\\)</span> (coordinate carriers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec{\\mathcal F}=\\langle\\mathcal F_i:i\\in I\\rangle\">\\(\\vec{\\mathcal F}=\\langle\\mathcal F_i:i\\in I\\rangle\\)</span> (coordinate sigma algebras)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec{\\mathbb P}=\\langle\\mathbb P_i:i\\in I\\rangle\">\\(\\vec{\\mathbb P}=\\langle\\mathbb P_i:i\\in I\\rangle\\)</span> (coordinate probability measures)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span> (product-measure candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\)</span> (probability-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" href=\"?note=29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite\">../batch04/58-df-finite</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_X(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\sigma_X(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> (generated sigma algebra, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2ProductProbability}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2ProductProbability}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}product\\text{-}probability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2ProductProbability}_S(\\mathbb P,\\vec{\\mathbb P},I)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec X,\\vec{\\mathcal F}\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X))\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal F},I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\mathcal F}))\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathbb P},I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\mathbb P}))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\vec X(i),\\vec{\\mathcal F}(i),\\vec{\\mathbb P}(i))\n\\land\n\\exists\\Omega,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal F\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\Omega=\\{x:\\mathrm{Function}(x,I,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X))\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(x(i)\\in\\vec X(i))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\n\\mathcal G=\\{\\{x\\in\\Omega:x(i)\\in A\\}:i\\in I\\land A\\in\\vec{\\mathcal F}(i)\\}\n\\land\\mathcal F=\\sigma_\\Omega(\\mathcal G)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\n\\forall J\\subseteq I\\;\\forall a\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(J)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,J,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\mathcal F}))\n\\land\\forall j\\in J\\;(a(j)\\in\\vec{\\mathcal F}(j))\n\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\qquad\n\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\n\\{x\\in\\Omega:\\forall j\\in J\\;x(j)\\in a(j)\\}\n\\right)\n=\n\\prod_{j\\in J}\\vec{\\mathbb P}(j)(a(j))\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}product\\text{-}probability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2ProductProbability}_S(\\mathbb P,\\vec{\\mathbb P},I)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec X,\\vec{\\mathcal F}\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X))\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal F},I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\mathcal F}))\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathbb P},I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\mathbb P}))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\vec X(i),\\vec{\\mathcal F}(i),\\vec{\\mathbb P}(i))\n\\land\n\\exists\\Omega,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal F\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\Omega=\\{x:\\mathrm{Function}(x,I,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X))\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(x(i)\\in\\vec X(i))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\n\\mathcal G=\\{\\{x\\in\\Omega:x(i)\\in A\\}:i\\in I\\land A\\in\\vec{\\mathcal F}(i)\\}\n\\land\\mathcal F=\\sigma_\\Omega(\\mathcal G)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\n\\forall J\\subseteq I\\;\\forall a\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(J)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,J,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\mathcal F}))\n\\land\\forall j\\in J\\;(a(j)\\in\\vec{\\mathcal F}(j))\n\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\qquad\n\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\n\\{x\\in\\Omega:\\forall j\\in J\\;x(j)\\in a(j)\\}\n\\right)\n=\n\\prod_{j\\in J}\\vec{\\mathbb P}(j)(a(j))\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The defining cylinder equation now includes the coordinate spaces, sigma algebras, product carrier, and generated product sigma algebra.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure","status":"resolved","id":"29e8d6cd15d08f4f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure","status":"resolved","id":"29e8d6cd15d08f4f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S$ (probability-measure predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}$ (fini